      '<circle cx="20.5" cy="30.5" r="2.6"/><circle cx="27.5" cy="30.5" r="2.6"/>' +
    '</svg>',
  /* MAX 5: the same pad shell, but with the interceptor board showing
     through it — this product IS a board that lives inside the pad, and
     the picker should not show it with the identical drawing as the
